OL,3,GNEWSAPolice find food worth more than
OL,4,A#5,000 in car boot
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #5,000-worth of suspected
OL,7,Fstolen food, including chocolate,
OL,8,Fcheese and chorizo, has been discovered
OL,9,Fin the boot of a car by police.
OL,11,FOfficers thought the vehicle was
OL,12,Flooking a little low to the ground as
OL,13,Fit travelled along the A16, between
OL,14,FPeterborough, Crowland, and Spalding,
OL,15,Fon Friday.
OL,17,FOn stopping the car at about 14:00 BST,
OL,18,Fthey found 58 bottles of olive oil, 14
OL,19,Ftins of tuna, 399 packs of chocolates,
OL,20,Fa large amount of coffee, cheese and
OL,21,Fchorizo, and cleaning products.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
