OL,3,GNEWSAPolice find food worth more than
OL,4,A#5,000 in car boot
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We know people like to start stocking
OL,7,Fup for Christmas, but this is a tad
OL,8,Fextreme," said a police spokesperson.
